$date October 2026 $end
$version VLSI Toolkit AXI example: traffic with planted protocol bugs $end
$timescale 1ns $end
$scope module tb $end
$var wire 1 ! aclk $end
$var wire 1 " aresetn $end
$scope module dut $end
$var wire 1 # s_axi_awvalid $end
$var wire 1 $ s_axi_awready $end
$var wire 32 % s_axi_awaddr [31:0] $end
$var wire 8 & s_axi_awlen [7:0] $end
